      "currentState": "既存catalog/passport/inspect/prepare/execute/Package等を再利用。全OAuth/外部feed/作者SDK実Providerは一括readyではない。",
      "algorithm": "版付きmanifestで作者署名/Tool schema/permissions/origin/data/cost/licenseを登録→inspect/negotiation→本人Add→OAuth state/PKCE/redirect bindingまたは既存credential→server保存→quote/digest→Broker prepare/execute→receipt→revoke。read/write/notify/billingを別scope、dynamic schema変更は再review。 catalogはauthor draft→review→publish→add→versioned update→revoke/deleteを既存schemaへ対応し、old jobは固定旧版参照で閲覧を維持。依存lock/source/license/作者identity/脆弱依存を審査、価格版とExecutor適格条件をstrict parserで検証。接続先はこのPC/Sky Cloud/提供者をdoctorで選択しlocal transport/origin/auth/capabilityを比較。MCP initialize→initialized→tools/list→call→schema/result照合を実Connectorで検証。作者SDKはfresh導入/最小実Tool/取消/再接続/版互換/権利診断を測定。",
      "inputsAndOutputs": "入力=package/endpoint/capability/schema/OAuth proof/owner grant/job/revision/quote。出力=登録/接続/実行の別状態、互換診断、usage/artifact/失効receipt。",
      "stateAndPersistence": "tokenは用途別保護領域、公開catalogに置かない。Package/source/contract版をjobへ固定、作者SDKはpoint発行/Wallet記帳/OS鍵を持たない。",
      "migration": "既存catalog/API/schemaのSmith改名は表示中心で内部互換保持。既存Toolへadapter追記し二重registryや包括shellを作らない。OAuth依存SDK/公式仕様は実装時最新primary source確認。",
      "failureRecovery": "inspect失敗/expired token/撤回/429/schema driftは接続/仕事をunknown/blockedにし再認可前に送信しない。effect不明は同idempotency key照合、revoke後新dispatch拒否。",
      "negativeTests": [
